Pulse — Greeting Update

Changes:
- Greeting is based on the browser's current local time.
- 05:00–11:59: Good morning 👋
- 12:00–17:59: Good afternoon ☀️
- 18:00–04:59: Good evening 🌙
- Greeting refreshes automatically every 60 seconds while the dashboard is open.
- Service-worker cache name was bumped to force the updated index.html to load.

Deployment:
Replace index.html, manifest.json, sw.js and README.md in the existing GitHub Pages repository. Keep the existing config.js unchanged.
